<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for taking the time to get in touch about your Frequent Flyer profile.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">On top of our standard meals, we also offer our customers a selection of special menus to cater for particular dietary requirements. Our special meals list is based on one drawn up by the International Air Transport Association and agreed by major airlines across the world. It sets out the specifications for each kind of special meal and, though it doesn’t allow for every single dietary requirement, it does cover the most common ones.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Our special meals list doesn’t include a meal specifically for customers who <b>-<i>specify their needs etc-</i></b>.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If suggesting meal add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We do however have a <b>-<i>SPECIFY MEAL-</i></b> which does not include <b>-<i>list details-</i></b>. And of course, you are also welcome to bring your own food on board the flight.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><font size="2">-<i>If haven’t specified what they can/can’t eat add:-</i></font></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">If you would like to contact us via webchat on qantas.con or call on 13 13 13, we would be happy to talk you through what is and isn’t included in each meal, to see which option best meets your needs. You are also welcome to bring your own food on board the flight.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I have made a note of your comments for future management reviews, so we appreciate you taking the time to provide your suggestions to us. I hope that this information has been of assistance and we look forward to welcoming you on board Qantas soon.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>